        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_1",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "嘘咩……我们小小声说。{A豆豆眼}\n<style=SizeSmall>可不敢给淘气的小家伙们听到啦！</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_2",
                "value": "嘘咩……我们小小声说。{A豆豆眼}\n<style=SizeSmall>可不敢给淘气的小家伙们听到啦！</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_3",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "前两天，我正准备按照平常的习惯，\n把下一次制作玩偶的毛线团，\n一格、一格地咩起来，按照创意收纳好。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_4",
                "value": "前两天，我正准备按照平常的习惯，\n把下一次制作玩偶的毛线团，\n一格、一格地咩起来，按照创意收纳好。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_5",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A想象}花生玩偶要用到黄白色小线团……\n烟囱玩偶要用到的砖红色小线团…\n每个小格子，都是新玩偶的灵感！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_6",
                "value": "{A想象}花生玩偶要用到黄白色小线团……\n烟囱玩偶要用到的砖红色小线团…\n每个小格子，都是新玩偶的灵感！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_7",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A豆豆眼}结果，没完成的玩偶突然“淘气”起来，\n从柜子里滑出来，牵着整理好的线团，\n把线溜得到处都是……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_8",
                "value": "{A豆豆眼}结果，没完成的玩偶突然“淘气”起来，\n从柜子里滑出来，牵着整理好的线团，\n把线溜得到处都是……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_9",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "等到再次收拾好，格子已经完全乱套啦！\n于是，我只能把所有弄乱的毛线团，\n重新构思，做成了全新的玩偶。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_10",
                "value": "等到再次收拾好，格子已经完全乱套啦！\n于是，我只能把所有弄乱的毛线团，\n重新构思，做成了全新的玩偶。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_11",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "有趣的是！经过玩偶牵线后的线团，\n做出的玩偶，有特别的设计感！{A灵光一现}\n就像玩偶和我共同创作的一样。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_12",
                "value": "有趣的是！经过玩偶牵线后的线团，\n做出的玩偶，有特别的设计感！{A灵光一现}\n就像玩偶和我共同创作的一样。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_13",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "咩哼哼！于是，我决定筹备，\n和玩偶们共同创作的“灵感下午茶”——\n用家具装饰出和玩偶们共度的下午茶时光。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_14",
                "value": "咩哼哼！于是，我决定筹备，\n和玩偶们共同创作的“灵感下午茶”——\n用家具装饰出和玩偶们共度的下午茶时光。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_15",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "不过，在此之前，{A挑衅坏笑}\n可不能让淘气的玩偶们来捣乱啦！\n于是，我打电话拜托<style=PlayerName>{玩家昵称}</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_16",
                "value": "不过，在此之前，{A挑衅坏笑}\n可不能让淘气的玩偶们来捣乱啦！\n于是，我打电话拜托<style=PlayerName>{玩家昵称}</style>。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 0
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_17",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "可以帮帮我咩？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1200201_textmap_18",
                "value": "可以帮帮我咩？",
