                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "最后，最重要的是，邀请淘气的玩偶，\n请它们，坐在下午茶台上，提供灵感的——\n<style=Highlight>毛绒偶憩玩偶台</style>，就由你来。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
